[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Caro-Kann Defence: Advance Variation"]
[Variation "Exchange Variation"]
[ECO "B13"]
[Character "solid,positional"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "open-centre,piece-activity"]
[Kind "sideline"]

1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 { A simple alternative: trade pawns and play a normal open game without learning the Advance. } 3... cxd5 4. Bd3 { Aims at h7 and the kingside; the bishop is not bothered by the closed centre. } 4... Nc6 5. c3 { Props up d4 and leaves the queen a square on c2. } 5... Nf6 6. Bf4 { Develops the bishop outside the pawn chain, before ...e6 can lock it out. } 6... Bg4 7. Qb3 { Hits b7 and d5 together. } 7... Qd7 8. Nd2 e6 *
